'aft.find': 'One observation does not fit the notebook: do you test it now, tell the whole colony, or keep it among the officers?',
'aft.beds': 'The clinic is overflowing: do you run the autodoc until everyone is well, stitch them by hand and send them back to work, or treat only the ones who will work again?',
