'und.answer': 'Do you accept the meadow\'s offer of living soil for the colony\'s waste, try it on one field for a season, or refuse and burn the map?',
'und.price': 'A dying colonist asks to be laid in the meadow: do you allow it, refuse, use the burial to ask the meadow for something, or send all your dead there from now on?',
'bld.find': 'What do you do about the buried plane and its spire: dig down to it, study it with instruments, send people down it, or fence it off?',
'bld.wake': (s, c) => c && c.first ? `Do you send an expedition through the opening, blow it shut, or stay out and take what ${c.first} draws, letting ${c.first} rest or keeping ${c.first} awake?` : 'Do you send an expedition through the opening, blow it shut, or stay out and take what the one who touched it draws?',
