'oth.signal': 'Do you answer the old ship\'s beacon, listen without transmitting, go dark, or send people south, a few quietly or ten armed?',
'oth.contact': 'Eleven from the Reach have come to talk: do you trade with them, take them in as guests, rob them and send them home, or seize them at the gate?',
